.TH "GEARADMIN" "1" "Jul 22, 2026" "2.0.0" "Gearmand"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gearadmin \- Gearmand Documentation, https://gearman.org/gearmand/
.sp
Run Administrative commands against a server.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-help
Provice help about the program.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-create\-function
Create a function from the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-h [ \-\-host ] arg (=localhost)i
Connect to the host
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-p [ \-\-port ] arg (=4730)
Port number or service to use for connection
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-drop\-function
Drop a function from the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-server\-version
Fetch the version number for the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-server\-verbose
Fetch the verbose setting for the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-status
Status for the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-workers
Workers for the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-cancel\-job
Remove a given job from the server\(aqs queue.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-show\-unique\-jobs
Show unique IDs of jobs on the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-show\-jobs
Show all jobs on the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-getpid
Get Process ID for the server.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-priority\-status
Queued jobs status by priority.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-S [ \-\-ssl ]
Enable SSL connections.
.UNINDENT
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Command line tool for manipulating gearmand servers.
.SH HOME
.sp
To find out more information please check:
\fI\%https://gearman.org/gearmand/\fP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
